---
description: Review affected documentation when source changes
globs: "tools/**,scripts/**,apps/**,services/**,packages/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

When source changes, review ARCHITECTURE.md for components/public interfaces, CONTRIBUTING.md for commands, doc/DEPLOYMENT.md for release steps, and doc/QUALITY_SCORE.md for evidence. Add material new design decisions through doc/README.md's lifecycle. Derived documentation must reference its real producer. Run npm run verify before handoff.
